A||||11||spike||Custom Sub Box||||5||
Z||000000||spike||01-31-2000||12:48 PM||||As some of you might have read in previous posts I will be selling a custom made to fit Sub Box for the Fiero. There will be 2 versions of the box offered. A box to fit 2 10 inch subs and one for 2 12 inch subs. I would like to get your feed back as to a fair price for these boxes. The boxes come with a plexiglass window and matching color vynle. These boxes fit inside the cabin and are such a tight fit that nothing is needed to hold them in place. Speakers will not be included in the price. You may loose about 1/2-1 inch which is not very noticable. When I had my 87 Fiero GT about 2 years ago I had the 2 10 inch sub box in it. The sound was very good. Plenty of hard hitting BASS and low BOOM. I am in the process of purchasing another Fiero at this time. I need to wait till I get my Fiero to build the box for measurement requirments. Plexiglass alone costs 30.00 and the vynle another 15.00. Wood<BR>about 30.00 screws 5.00 and sylicone sealer about 3.00. The total cost for material is about 83.00 CDN. dollars. So how much should I charge for my time. I would say it takes about 5hrs. to build a complete box ready for subs. The box itself has many angled cuts<BR>to fit the inside contour of the Fiero. It will fit in any Fiero, any model and any year.<P>Thank you, Mike.||||reg||5
